{"id":"recompensa","lemma":"recompensa","pos":"noun","rank":1665,"glosses":["reward, recompense","bounty","recompense, indemnification (act of compensation)"],"ipa":"/rekomˈpensa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"recompensas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-recompensa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Era demasiado orgulloso como para aceptar cualquier recompensa.","en":"He was too proud to accept any reward.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689031","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"too much"},{"g":"proud"},null,null,{"g":"to accept"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"to"]]},{"text":"Tom merece una recompensa.","en":"Tom deserves a reward.","words":[null,{"g":"to deserve","l":"merecer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La recompensa es tentadora.","en":"The reward is enticing.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"tempting","l":"tentador"}]},{"text":"Habrá una recompensa para quien encuentre a mi perro.","en":"There will be a reward for the person who finds my dog.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"dog"}]},{"text":"Se le dio un reloj de oro como recompensa.","en":"He was given a gold watch as a reward.","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"clock"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"gold."},{"g":"as"},null]}]}